cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository or its reproducibility materials, please cite this repository and the associated publication when available. Individual publications and third-party openEHR artifacts may have separate citation and licensing requirements."
title: "openEHR Episode-Oriented Medical Record Research"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Messerli
    given-names: Jean-Pierre
repository-code: "https://github.com/JPM-Consulting/openEHR-Masterclass-thesis"
abstract: >-
  Research repository containing openEHR modelling artifacts, publications,
  a synthetic longitudinal patient record, and manuscript-specific
  reproducibility materials for the comparative evaluation of FOLDER-, LINK-,
  and CLUSTER-based approaches to representing Episode-of-Care relationships.
keywords:
  - openEHR
  - Episode of Care
  - electronic health record
  - clinical information model
  - FOLDER
  - LINK
  - CLUSTER
